<Layout
    title="About"
    description="Who makes Gaby and Nope, and where the domain name comes from."
>
    <p>
        I'm Eugene De Los Santos. I build backend systems for a living and ship small apps on
        the side — <a href="/gaby/">Gaby</a>, for rehearsing Spanish out loud before you have to
        speak it, and <a href="/nope/">Nope</a>, for putting a pause in front of the sites that
        eat your afternoon. Both work offline and collect nothing.
    </p>

    <p>
        The domain <strong>edsa.tech</strong> is a nod to EDSA (Epifanio de los Santos Avenue),
        the longest highway in the Philippines and a namesake of my uncle Epifanio.
    </p>

    <p>
        Support for either app: <a href="mailto:support@edsa.tech">support@edsa.tech</a>.
        Code: <a href="https://github.com/delose" target="_blank">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
</Layout>
